# Machine software interrupt preempts a delegated supervisor external handler.
# Host setup preloads:
# - privilege = User
# - controller source 1 enabled, routed to supervisor, and pending
# - mideleg enables supervisor external interrupts
# - mie enables machine software interrupts
# - sie enables supervisor external interrupts
# - stvec = 0x20, mtvec = 0x60
# User mainline is interrupted into a supervisor handler. That handler claims and
# completes the controller source, records x10 = 10, raises MSIP through MMIO,
# then later resumes to record x11 = 11 and return with sret. The machine
# handler clears MSIP, records x12 = 12, and returns with mret.
# Expect x1 = 1, x10 = 10, x11 = 11, x12 = 12, privilege = User, pc = 0x4.
